#: ../../talk/bots.rst:2
msgid "Bots and commands"
msgstr "Bots og kommandoer"

#: ../../talk/bots.rst:5
msgid "Bots"
msgstr "Bots"

#: ../../talk/bots.rst:7
msgid ""
"Bots can respond to chat messages, provide automated replies, and integrate "
"with external services. Your administrator can enable bots for your Talk "
"instance."
msgstr ""
"Bots kan svare på chatbeskeder, sende automatiske svar og arbejde sammen med"
" eksterne tjenester. Din administrator kan slå bots til på din Talk-instans."

#: ../../talk/bots.rst:9
msgid "Some examples of available bots:"
msgstr "Nogle eksempler på bots:"

#: ../../talk/bots.rst:11
msgid ""
"**Call summary** — Posts an overview message after a call ends, listing all "
"participants and outlining any tasks that were mentioned."
msgstr ""
"**Opkaldsopsummering** — Sender en oversigt, når et opkald er slut, med alle"
" deltagere og de opgaver, der blev nævnt."

#: ../../talk/bots.rst:12
msgid ""
"**Agenda bot** — Helps manage meeting agendas with time monitoring and "
"permission-based access control."
msgstr ""
"**Agenda-bot** — Hjælper med at styre dagsordenen for møder med tidsstyring "
"og adgang ud fra rettigheder."

#: ../../talk/bots.rst:13
msgid "**Roll a dice** — Type ``/roll`` in a conversation to roll dice."
msgstr ""
"**Slå med terning** — Skriv ``/roll`` i en samtale for at slå med terning."

#: ../../talk/bots.rst:15
msgid ""
"A full list of available bots and installation instructions can be found in "
"the `Talk administration documentation <https://nextcloud-"
"talk.readthedocs.io/en/latest/bot-list/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Den fulde liste over bots og vejledning i at installere dem finder du i "
"`dokumentationen til administration af Talk <https://nextcloud-"
"talk.readthedocs.io/en/latest/bot-list/>`_."

#: ../../talk/bots.rst:18
msgid "Commands"
msgstr "Kommandoer"

#: ../../talk/bots.rst:21
msgid "Commands have been removed in favor of Bots."
msgstr "Kommandoer er fjernet til fordel for bots."

#: ../../talk/bots.rst:23
msgid ""
"Nextcloud allows users to execute actions using commands. A command "
"typically looks like:"
msgstr ""
"I Nextcloud kan brugere udføre handlinger med kommandoer. En kommando ser "
"typisk sådan ud:"

#: ../../talk/bots.rst:25
msgid "``/wiki airplanes``"
msgstr "``/wiki airplanes``"

#: ../../talk/bots.rst:27
msgid ""
"Administrators can configure, enable and disable commands. Users can use the"
" ``help`` command to find out what commands are available."
msgstr ""
"Administratorer kan indstille, slå til og slå kommandoer fra. Brugere kan "
"bruge kommandoen ``help`` til at se, hvilke kommandoer der findes."

#: ../../talk/bots.rst:29
msgid "``/help``"
msgstr "``/help``"
